{"reviews":[{"id":"B01ISIU16I-0","r":5.0,"t":"Best hand lotion ever!!","x":"I was introduced to this lotion at the salon I go to for pedicures and fell in love with it. I work for a dermatologist and have tried just about every lotion, cream, ointment and potion for extremely dry hands but this stuff is the best and it never lets me down. It also has the lightest most delicious scent.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-1","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Product!!","x":"I have used it through my radiation treatments due to breast cancer. My Radiologist Oncologist is surprised at how well my skin is doing. I highly recommend this product!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-2","r":5.0,"t":"Best Lotion on Market","x":"Da Bomb as far as lotions are concerned. No greasy, fast absorbing, natural, love the scent, luxurious. 7/2019 Update it appears the manufacturer may not be making this any more YIKES! Amazon\u2019s our so if anyone sees it anywhere besides eBay for the unreal price of $50!!! Talk about price scheming. Help!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-3","r":5.0,"t":"Bottle arrived open","x":"The only reason I gave a 1 star in value for money  is because the original order and the replacement order came on bags with the bottle open and lotion squirted inside of the bag. Very disappointed in Amazon\u2019s shipping.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-4","r":3.0,"t":"Smells very nice, not greasy","x":"Lotion feels good, not greasy, and smells vey nice, but packaging leaves much to be desired. Much of it was in the bag when t arrived. Seller needs to fix this problem.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-5","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!!","x":"I don\u2019t typically like to wear lotion but this lotion is great. It goes on thin and light, doesn\u2019t leave a greasy feeling and the smell is amazing. I highly recommend.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-6","r":5.0,"t":"Smells wonderful.","x":"Absorbs well and softens my very dry skin.  Smells wonderful.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-7","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love it and scent is wonderful and good ingredients","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product!","x":"Love this!!  Not greasy, but coats skin well.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-9","r":5.0,"t":"Shipping issues","x":"Nice product. Acquired a bottle elsewhere and decided to purchase the same thing on Amazon.  The product seems to moisturize well and help dry, chapped skin. The negative was in the shipment. The cap on the dispenser was loose and some product leaked.  Not enough to return, but packaging could be a lot better. The manufacturer tried to seal the cap and plunger with some type of plastic heat wrap. Doesn\u2019t work. You may receive an intact bottle, or one like I had with some minor spillage or open t","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-10","r":5.0,"t":"Deluxe salon quality lotion","x":"My nail salon used this lotion on me after a pedicure. I love the scent so much that I looked it up to buy some for my home. I use it every night before bed. Unlike other lotions, the scent lasts a long time. I only gave 4 stars for value however, because it is very costly.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-11","r":3.0,"t":"Not as rich in oils as tge ither formulas!","x":"This Ciyrus scent formular is thinner and not as moisture rich as the Avocado and the Olive oil formula. I do not like this citrus firmula as well. Would not reorder. Alsi kind of pricey esoecially if not happy with it. Skin still ferls dry after applying product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-12","r":4.0,"t":"Really nice lotion but...","x":"So this product is very moisturizing but the top came defective, it still works but it\u2019s still half torn off. Also this lotion is a tiny bit oily btw but i still recommend it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-13","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing scent","x":"This lotion is awesome- I tried it at my nail salon, found it online and for the money it\u2019s a solid buy.  The scent is great and it leaves your hands very soft.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-14","r":5.0,"t":"Love this lotion","x":"I use this in the summer when I don't need such a heavy lotion for my dry skin.  The scent is nice and not overpowering.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-15","r":5.0,"t":"Pleasant lotion","x":"This is great lotion.  My manicurist used it on my arms and it felt so good, was not sticky and has a lovely scent.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-16","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful aroma","x":"Not only is it a great moisturizer, its great aroma therapy too!  Makes me feel relaxed and happy.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-17","r":1.0,"t":"Product quality not there","x":"Product not the same. Not happy with the product I received.  Will not reorder. Do not purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-18","r":5.0,"t":"It's a wonderful product","x":"It is a wonderful product I recommend it to anyone  I will be ordering more of it ASAP \ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udc9e","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-19","r":5.0,"t":"little expensive","x":"I really liked this product, the moisture the smell all of it a little expensive though","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-20","r":5.0,"t":"You need this lotion.","x":"This is the best body lotion I have used. My skin is so soft! I highly recommend it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-21","r":5.0,"t":"Incredible purchased","x":"I love this lotion but it's so expensive. Worth every penny and I buy it again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-22","r":4.0,"t":"Good Quality Lotion","x":"Bought this for my husband and it's one of his current favorite body lotions.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-23","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful product!!","x":"I use this product daily. I love the smell & moisturizing effect.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01ISIU16I-24","r":5.0,"t":"You will love it !!","x":"One of the best hand and body lotions I\u2019ve ever used, love it!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the pleasant scent, describing it as wonderful and long-lasting.","cites":[3,5,6,7,8,11,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the lotion is non-greasy, absorbs well, and leaves skin soft and moisturized.","cites":[3,5,6,7,9,10,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers report packaging and shipping problems, with bottles arriving open or leaking.","cites":[4,5,10,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the product expensive or pricey.","cites":[3,11,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the formula feels thinner or less moisturizing, leaving skin dry.","cites":[12,13]}]},"qa":[]}